#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view the bookmarks home page enter <userinput>bookmarks:/</userinput> "
"in the location bar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
